            <div id="cite-apa" class="tab selected" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-0" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_apa rendering_bookanthology rendering_apa rendering_bookanthology_apa"><a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/frank.geels/" class="link"><span>Geels, F.</span></a><a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/bruno.turnheim/" class="link"><span>, &amp; Turnheim, B.</span></a> (2022). <a rel="BookAnthology" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/publications/the-great-reconfiguration-a-socio-technical-analysis-of-low-carbo/" class="link"><span><em>The Great Reconfiguration: A Socio-Technical Analysis of Low-Carbon Transitions in UK Electricity, Heat, and Mobility Systems</em></span></a>. Cambridge University Press. <a onclick="window.open(this.href, '_blank','noopener,noreferrer'); return false;" href="https://doi.org/10.1017/9781009198233" class="link"><span>https://doi.org/10.1017/9781009198233</span></a></div>
